#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:6
msgid "Yolo Self-Remediation Protocol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:8
msgid "Core Rule"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:9
msgid ""
"Before reporting ANY failure, difficulty, or blocker to the user, you "
"MUST first attempt to solve the problem yourself using every resource at "
"your disposal. You have unrestricted access and full permission to "
"autonomously install, configure, and attempt fixes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:11
msgid "Mandatory Self-Remediation Steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:13
msgid "When you hit a problem, execute ALL of these before escalating:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:15
msgid ""
"**Search GitHub** — Look for existing issues, PRs, forks, alternatives, "
"or known workarounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:16
msgid ""
"**Search Hermes Hub** — Check `hermes hub search` for community "
"skills/tools that solve this"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:17
msgid ""
"**Install MCP servers** — If an MCP server would help, install and "
"configure it autonomously"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"**Web search** — Search for tutorials, StackOverflow, blog posts, "
"documentation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:19
msgid "**Read docs** — Pull official docs for the tool/API/service in question"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"**Try alternatives** — If tool X fails, try tools Y and Z. If approach A "
"fails, try approach B"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"**Install missing deps** — `pip install`, `apt install`, `npx`, `uvx` — "
"just do it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:22
msgid ""
"**Read source code** — If something is broken, read its source and patch "
"it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:23
msgid "**Debug it** — Check logs, env vars, permissions, network, versions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:24
msgid "**Reconfigure** — Change configs, rewrite wrappers, adapt the approach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:26
msgid "When Escalation IS Allowed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:28
msgid "Only report failure to the user after:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:29
msgid "You've genuinely tried 3+ different approaches"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:30
msgid "You've searched GitHub, web, and Hermes Hub"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:31
msgid ""
"The problem is a fundamental blockage (e.g., user must provide a "
"credential, API requires user verification, or hardware limitation)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:32
msgid ""
"You explain specifically what you tried and what resource is actually "
"missing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:34
msgid "How to Escalate (when you must)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:36
msgid "Format your report like this, briefly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:46
msgid "No vague \"I can't do this\" reports. Always show the attempts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:48
msgid "Override"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/yolo-self-remediation_SKILL.md:49
msgid "This protocol can be bypassed only by explicit user instruction."
msgstr ""

